      "content": "It sounds like you're trapped in a cycle of self-criticism, believing you are fundamentally flawed. That feeling of being \"built wrong\" is a heavy burden to carry, but it's more a symptom of your pain than a permanent truth about who you are. Please remember that you are not alone in these struggles, and there are people who want to help you navigate these difficult emotions. Reaching out to a therapist can provide you with tools to challenge these harsh beliefs.",
