    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it isn't just a \"symptom\"? what if it's just the truth? i look at the world and i see how much better it would be if people like me just weren't in it. if i'm just a net negative to everyone around me, then why am i even here? it just feels like i'm taking up room that better people could use.",
